[node name="tutorialDiscoverIngress" parent="." instance=ExtResource("2_7r03o")]
visible = false
layout_mode = 0
target_objective_wID = "tutorialDiscoverIngress"
text_box_size = Vector2(300, 100)
track = NodePath("../../control/tabs_and_ca_scroll/tabs_actions_scroll/actions_panel")
track_offset = Vector2(0, -300)
info = "Awesome - the location of Ingress has been added to the SYSTEM LIST! However, it has not yet been discovered. A body can be discovered by seeing it up close.

To discover Ingress, press on '???' on the SYSTEM LIST to lock, and then press the 'ORBIT' action in the ACTIONS PANEL.
[img]res://graphics/system-map/actions-panel/orbit_icon.png[/img]"

[node name="tutorialFollowIngress" parent="." instance=ExtResource("2_7r03o")]
visible = false
layout_mode = 0
target_objective_wID = "tutorialFollowIngress"
text_box_size = Vector2(300, 100)
track = NodePath("../../control/tabs_and_ca_scroll/tabs_actions_scroll/tabs/OVERVIEW")
info = "Excellent work!

Wormholes like Ingress are how you progress in [i]Stellar Cartographer[/i]. When all bodies are discovered, or a star system is too dangerous, find a wormhole to take you to the next star system. [color=yellow]Traversing a wormhole requires interacting with it[/color].

To traverse Ingress, press on 'Ingress' on the SYSTEM LIST to lock, and then press the 'GO-TO' action in the ACTIONS PANEL. 
[img]res://graphics/system-map/actions-panel/go_to_icon.png[/img]"

[node name="tutorialOptionalStunMarauder" parent="." instance=ExtResource("1_fpin1")]
visible = false
layout_mode = 0
offset_right = 240.0
offset_bottom = 66.0
target_objective_wID = "tutorialOptionalStunMarauder"
text_box_size = Vector2(250, 100)
track = NodePath("../../control/scopes_snap_scroll/scopes_bg/scopes_margin")
info = "Sometimes, a hostile unit is too fast to evade normally. A way to still evade such units is to [color=yellow]stun them[/color], stopping them from chasing you temporarily. Hostile units can be stunned by [color=yellow]pinging them[/color]. 

To ping the marauder starship, adjust the LIDAR direction so it matches the direction of the ship on the SYSTEM MAP, and press the 'PING' button."

[node name="tutorialOptionalUnderstandUnits" parent="." instance=ExtResource("1_fpin1")]
visible = false
layout_mode = 1
anchors_preset = 8
anchor_left = 0.5
anchor_top = 0.5
anchor_right = 0.5
anchor_bottom = 0.5
offset_left = -120.0
offset_top = -275.0
offset_right = 120.0
offset_bottom = -208.99968
grow_horizontal = 2
grow_vertical = 2
target_objective_wID = "tutorialOptionalUnderstandUnits"
text_box_size = Vector2(500, 0)
info = "Oh no - a marauder ship has appeared within your 'SCANNER PROFILE'! It will steal your technology if it catches you on the SYSTEM MAP. You must evade it!
[img]res://graphics/objective/tutorial_hostile_unit_example.png[/img]
Units are [color=yellow]bodies that move on their own terms[/color] - like ships. Units within your ship's 'SCANNER POWER' (dotted grey outer circle) are appended to the CONTACT LIST. Units within your ship's 'SCANNER PROFILE' (brown inner circle) [color=yellow]can see your ship and respond to its presence[/color].

To evade the marauder, right click [[img=2em2em]graphics/shared/mouse/mouse_right.png[/img]] to travel to your mouse pointer and hold $SC_BOOST to boost - [color=yellow]lead your starship away from the marauder so that it exits your 'SCANNER PROFILE'[/color], and then discover Ingress while avoiding redetection."

